       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.
           SINVDUED.
       AUTHOR.
           KURT MOVSESIAN/ANNETTE TREUDLER.
      *REMARKS.
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **  THIS SUBROUTINE CALCULATES THE DUE DATE FOR AN INVOICE **
      **  BASED ON THE INVOICE DATE AND PAYMENT TERMS.           **
      **   1) SINVDUED-DUE-DATE - INVOICE DUE DATE IN YMD        **
      **      FORMAT.                                            **
      **                                                         **
      *C*  07/12/1996   CA YODER                                 **
      *C*  REPLACED "JULIANDATE" AND "GREGDATE" ROUTINES WITH    **
      *C*  THE NEW "JULGREG" CALCULATION ROUTINE.                **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1                 PIC X VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2                 PIC X VALUE SPACES.

       01  S-CURRENT-JYY                PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROS COMP.
       01  S-INVOICE-JULIAN             PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROS COMP.
       01  S-DUE-JULIAN                 PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROS COMP.

      *--------- PARAMETERS FOR "JULGREG" ROUTINE.
       01  JULGREG-PARMS.
           05  GREG-DATE.
               10  GREG-CC          PIC X(2).
               10  GREG-YMD.
                   15  GREG-YY      PIC X(2).
                   15  GREG-MM      PIC X(2).
                   15  GREG-DD      PIC X(2).
           05  JULIAN-DATE.
               10  JUL-CC           PIC X(2).
               10  JUL-YY           PIC X(2).
               10  JUL-DDD          PIC X(3).
           05  JULIAN-DATE-9  REDEFINES  JULIAN-DATE.
               10  JUL-YEAR-9       PIC 9(4).
               10  JUL-DDD-9        PIC 9(3).
           05  DAY-DIGIT            PIC X.
           05  LEAP-YEAR-FLAG       PIC X.

       01  DATES-AND-TIMES.
           05  YMD-DATE.
               10  YMD-YY            PIC X(2).
               10  YMD-MM            PIC X(2).
               10  YMD-DD            PIC X(2).
           05  YMD-DATE-9  REDEFINES  YMD-DATE.
               10  YMD-YY-9          PIC 9(2).
               10  YMD-MM-9          PIC 9(2).
               10  YMD-DD-9          PIC 9(2).

       01  BUILD-TM-DUE-DATE-KEY.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(3)  VALUE "TMD".
           05  BUILD-TM-DATE-VALUE   PIC X     VALUE SPACES.


      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      **************************************************************

       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.

      *********************
      *                   *
      *   DATA SET NAMES  *
      *                   *
      *********************

       01  DSET-NAMES.
           05  DSET-MPLTINFO          PIC X(16)  VALUE "MPLTINFO;".

       COPY DBMODES IN COPYLIB.

       01 ITEMS-LISTING.
           05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC XX    VALUE "@;".

       01  ARG-VALUES.
           05  PLT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.



       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  BASE   PIC X(10).

       COPY SINVDUED IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

       01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           05  BU-DISPLAY-MSG-1         PIC X(1).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(59).

       01  BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
           05  BU-DISPLAY-LINE  OCCURS 5 TIMES.
               10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD       PIC X(14).
               10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9      PIC S9(8).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                SINVDUED-PARMS,
                                STATUS-AREA,
                                BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                                BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       PROC-DIV SECTION 01.


       1-BEGIN.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I.
           GOBACK.


      ******************************************************
      **                                                  **
      **   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
      **                                                  **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "SINVDUED"            TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5).
           GOBACK.


      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *     6 - M A I N                                *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************


       6-MAIN.
           MOVE SINVDUED-INV-DATE       TO  YMD-DATE.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO  SINVDUED-DUE-DATE.
           MOVE SINVDUED-TERMS-DUE-DATE TO  BUILD-TM-DATE-VALUE.
           MOVE BUILD-TM-DUE-DATE-KEY   TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           MOVE ZERO    TO COND-WORD.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
                INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                     MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
                ELSE
                     MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
      *    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
      *        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO, PLT-ARG.
           IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
               IF COND-WORD = 17
                   GO TO 6-M-X
               ELSE
                   MOVE "GET MPLTINFO 6-M" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

           IF MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG = "N"
               MOVE SINVDUED-INV-DATE   TO  SINVDUED-DUE-DATE
           ELSE
           IF MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG = "D"
               PERFORM 61-CALC-DAYS-DUE-DATE  THRU  61-CDDD-X
           ELSE
           IF MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG = "P"
               PERFORM 61-CALC-PROX-DUE-DATE  THRU  61-CPDD-X
           ELSE
               MOVE SINVDUED-INV-DATE   TO  SINVDUED-DUE-DATE.

       6-M-X.
           EXIT.

       61-CALC-DAYS-DUE-DATE.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO  JULGREG-PARMS.
           MOVE YMD-DATE                TO  GREG-YMD.
           IF GREG-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"                TO  GREG-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"                TO  GREG-CC.
           CALL "JULGREG"   USING GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                                  DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
           MOVE JUL-DDD                 TO  S-INVOICE-JULIAN.
           ADD MPLTINFO-D-OR-P, S-INVOICE-JULIAN  GIVING S-DUE-JULIAN.

       61-CALC-DUE-DATE-CONT.
           IF S-DUE-JULIAN < 366
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               SUBTRACT 365  FROM  S-DUE-JULIAN
               ADD 1                    TO  JUL-YEAR-9
               GO TO 61-CALC-DUE-DATE-CONT.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO  GREG-DATE.
           MOVE S-DUE-JULIAN            TO  JUL-DDD-9.
           CALL "JULGREG"   USING GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                                  DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG.
           MOVE GREG-YY                 TO  YMD-YY.
           MOVE GREG-MM                 TO  YMD-MM.
           MOVE GREG-DD                 TO  YMD-DD.
           MOVE YMD-DATE                TO  SINVDUED-DUE-DATE.

       61-CDDD-X.
           EXIT.


       61-CALC-PROX-DUE-DATE.
           IF MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG = "P"
               IF YMD-DD-9 < 16
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2  TO  YMD-DD-9
               ELSE
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-D-OR-P    TO  YMD-DD-9
                   ADD 1                   TO  YMD-MM-9
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-D-OR-P        TO  YMD-DD-9
               ADD 1                       TO  YMD-MM-9.
           IF YMD-MM-9 = 13
               ADD 1                       TO  YMD-YY-9
               MOVE 1                      TO  YMD-MM-9.

           MOVE YMD-DATE                   TO  SINVDUED-DUE-DATE.

       61-CPDD-X.
           EXIT.
